4163 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (CV Nurul Janah always prioritizes product availability while considering customer safety and health as the main aspects. The company is committed to preventing the use of hazardous materials in production, striving to increase customer trust in our products. To that end, the moringa leaf product manufacturing process is made as safe as possible, as an effort to ensure product safety and health. In addition, the company also conducts strict Quality Control on raw materials and finished products to maintain the quality of our products)
/K [4]
/P 4164 0 R
/Pg 2565 0 R
>>
